# mf-go Patterns

- Domain → Application → Infrastructure (strict dependency rule)
- Schema: `internal/infrastructure/graphql/schema/*.graphqls` — source of truth
- After schema changes: `make generate-all` in mf-go
- Use cases: `Execute(ctx, req) (resp, error)` pattern
- Errors: `internal/shared/errors` sentinels
- Postman: **one** collection (`mf-go/postman/masterfabric.collection.json`) and **one** environment (`mf-go/postman/masterfabric.environment.json`) — extend those files only; see `.cursor/rules/mf-go-ship-checklist.mdc` when shipping API changes
